[{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其七","author":"杨士奇","text":"明达之人无厚业，但求足给免寒饥。\n田多税重后来累，绊子缠孙今未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3623,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其八","author":"杨士奇","text":"天地生人皆有命，不须苦为子孙谋。\n诸杨田土连阡陌，身后何人保一邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3624,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其九","author":"杨士奇","text":"膝下诸孙玉不如，父慈只合训诗书。\n饱读诗书能变化，自然腾踏上天衢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3625,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十","author":"杨士奇","text":"森森孙子比明珠，总是先公积庆馀。\n佳妇佳儿勤善行，免教贻累及诸雏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3626,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十一","author":"杨士奇","text":"达士仁人宏度量，犯而不校务包荒。\n是非曲直人人识，狗彘何须与较量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3627,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十二","author":"杨士奇","text":"释道邪言总是诬，能明斯理即真儒。\n愚人苦被愚人弄，费尽千金寸福无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3628,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十三","author":"杨士奇","text":"东掊西取亡民怨，散施僧家与道家。\n如此善因求有福，有灾无福只堪嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3629,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十四","author":"杨士奇","text":"人生阴德由来好，周急怜贫济寡孤。\n不在缁黄誇布施，不教乡䣊怨侵渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3630,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十五","author":"杨士奇","text":"临财能让真君子，恃力誇豪总恶徒。\n忍气平心戒争竞，一生安稳绝忧虞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3631,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十六","author":"杨士奇","text":"父子强梁暴乡里，乡人怨忿切心肝。\n须臾沉没无遗颂，看取水南张状元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3632,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十七","author":"杨士奇","text":"年来狐豕纵横甚，假托声名指我家。\n我家若解持廉静，狐豕虽顽未敢哗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3633,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十八","author":"杨士奇","text":"立志应须学古人，读书方见古人真。\n煖衣饱食亡尘虑，窗下灯前莫厌勤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3634,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其十九","author":"杨士奇","text":"明窗净几閒临帖，东阁西斋静阅书。\n诸子娱亲时绕膝，清时清乐有谁如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3635,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十","author":"杨士奇","text":"六行由来数睦姻，士须重义勿轻贫。\n老夫家谱分明在，莫以新亲薄古亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3636,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十一","author":"杨士奇","text":"东城汝兄我亲侄，汝宜亲密无间疏。\n尽诚尽礼相匡翼，大家改辙由正途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3637,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十二","author":"杨士奇","text":"城东诸孙与我孙，兄弟同延老成教。\n记诵讲说课学程，日就月将见成效。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3638,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十三","author":"杨士奇","text":"每言臧获皆人子，曾写陶潜训子书。\n叮咛佳儿与佳妇，莫听谗谮虐无辜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3639,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十四","author":"杨士奇","text":"人家内外礼截然，僧道岂容陈寿帕。\n斯事传闻未必真，有之儒风扫地也。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3640,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十五","author":"杨士奇","text":"虔州李旭吾故交，汝醉逢之肆凌辱。\n方面两司向我言，使我低头内惭恧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3641,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十六","author":"杨士奇","text":"吾宗谨静务诗书，待制以来人共知。\n岂可甘令后人说，承家不淑自吾儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3642,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十七","author":"杨士奇","text":"吾儿今年三十二，已近人生半七十。\n不早转头脩善行，后来追悔何由及。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3643,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十八","author":"杨士奇","text":"老人热药犹常戒，况汝即今方壮年。\n京华两见谈星者，厄运须防四九前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3644,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其二十九","author":"杨士奇","text":"七十春秋雪满颠，都缘子侄苦忧煎。\n老人在世无多日，愿乞安心了暮年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3645,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄长儿韵语 其三十","author":"杨士奇","text":"人生至亲惟父子，备述恩情在于此。\n千言万语无他事，惟愿脩仁循义礼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3646,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈少卿南归 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"玉旨朝来下赤墀，遽传骑马发京师。\n崇文门外官亭柳，卧病无由赠一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3647,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈少卿南归 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"黄菊初花未有霜，锦袍归带御炉香。\n自缘白首怀桑梓，不为莼鲈忆故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3648,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈少卿南归 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"江上青山锦树明，归舟如在画图行。\n十年两奉天恩去，綵笔题诗一路清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3649,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄李广 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"平安寺畔相迎处，武姥峰前载酒时。\n思忆高情又三载，东风遥寄凤凰枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3650,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄李广 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"劲节虚心碧玉竿，凌霜傲雪拂云端。\n纤尘不到清阴下，最称溪南隐者看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3651,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送外甥周丹元 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"垂髫怜尔侍西行，此日相逢白发生。\n万里京华访遗老，他乡还重舅甥情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3652,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送外甥周丹元 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"西望临洮地苦寒，明时远戍莫辞难。\n好敦孝敬奉慈母，更尽勤诚悦上官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3653,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送外甥周丹元 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"渺渺江南道路长，故乡回首勿情伤。\n梅花自是江南物，但看梅花即故乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3654,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅与之序侄","author":"杨士奇","text":"盘中松竹如云雾，尚少梅花玉雪姿。\n置在草堂成四友，岁寒相对静相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3655,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题畿孙孔雀牡丹","author":"杨士奇","text":"洛阳高品移来满，南海雕笼入贡频。\n惟有武英边□诏，从游常看上林春。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3656,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题畿孙松梅鹤","author":"杨士奇","text":"绿云细剪葱茏叶，白玉香开错落花。\n何处飞来双鹤驭，画中疑是洞仙家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3657,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄萧元立","author":"杨士奇","text":"四年不见萧元立，遥忆新来满鬓霜。\n深结茅斋对岩竹，还依泉石种昌阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3658,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题萧婿承恕竹","author":"杨士奇","text":"凤凰池上写琅玕，便有清风五月寒。\n石台溪畔桃源里，最好萧斋静处看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3659,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题萧婿承恕东山图","author":"杨士奇","text":"早于尘外寄高閒，中岁安邦指顾间。\n画史岂知经济事，惟将适趣写东山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3660,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送曾永龄赴恭城知县 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"玉河桥东酌玉壶，崇文门外歌骊驹。\n铜章新绾广西去，一路春风听鹧鸪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3661,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送曾永龄赴恭城知县 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"新除令尹恭城县，万里驱驰过桂林。\n圣主恤民无远近，好勤绥抚体皇心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3662,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄雷道夫","author":"杨士奇","text":"孝感坊南看竹枝，高斋同咏武公诗。\n交情四十馀年在，黄鹤白云劳远思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3663,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题德贯牡丹松鹤","author":"杨士奇","text":"虬松千丈拂青云，初下云间散诞身。\n画史安知海天意，粉图空写洛阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3664,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侄婿刘铉南归 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"忆过沙溪访隐君，静安堂上倒芳樽。\n转头流水六十载，今日燕山遇乃孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3665,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送侄婿刘铉南归 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"沙溪溪上幽且深，桑麻粳稻易黄金。\n更莫远行江汉上，从来汉水荡人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3666,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄彦实侄","author":"杨士奇","text":"清江一曲绕柴门，乐志轩中隐趣繁。\n满种琅玕隔尘杂，更裁简册课儿孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3667,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题木石小画与镛孙","author":"杨士奇","text":"奕奕西昌贞节门，黄陂丰采见曾孙。\n须以诗书振勋业，莫随木石老邱樊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3668,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送辉侄归宣城 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"家住珠林楚水滨，林端岁岁凤毛新。\n草堂数世今无恙，但保诗书启后人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3669,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送辉侄归宣城 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"故家同是竹林人，万里重来意独亲。\n垂老还坚岁寒操，要看高节拂青旻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3670,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送辉侄归宣城 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"敬亭山水产贤英，在昔文章属有声。\n天上铨曹待成迹，几年承禄教宣城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3671,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题辉侄梅","author":"杨士奇","text":"鱼浦龙洲五百年，几家文献故依然。\n岁寒人共梅花好，始是吾宗清白传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3672,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹与镛孙","author":"杨士奇","text":"我家贤弟珠林下，逝者宁知生者悲。\n四十七年长在梦，眼前慰意见孙枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3673,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孝友堂","author":"杨士奇","text":"一门孝友同天性，为爱宋家三凤凰。\n不见河东祥与览，千春简册有辉光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3674,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵松雪画马","author":"杨士奇","text":"天闲第一渥洼姿，卓荦腾骧肯受羁。\n何不翻然绝牵控，蹑云追电看神奇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3675,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"具庆堂 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"白玉娟娟粉署郎，明时具庆筑高堂。\n天恩宠赐天曹禄，五彩衣裳献寿觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3676,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"具庆堂 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"紫诰鸾翔下九天，龙章辉映绮堂前。\n人生何幸亲长健，荣捧天恩过百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3677,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题行吟泽畔图","author":"杨士奇","text":"尚有?狂箕子奴，忧心何独楚三闾。\n扁舟鼓枻长歌者，不是从前荷蒉徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3678,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅花赠宋洵南京户部检校","author":"杨士奇","text":"妙年冠带仕京华，桥梓光荣共一家。\n但遣襟怀如玉雪，簿书閒暇对梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3679,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧母蒋氏挽诗 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"结悦来嫔君子室，琴声容易变孤鸾。\n来时皎皎鸣珰玉，直到泉台似昔看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3680,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧母蒋氏挽诗 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"清□白雪照孀居，闭户常勤教子书。\n八十全归□无憾，即看华表树门闾。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3681,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧母蒋氏挽诗 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"孝子南归望白云，麻衣血泪湿纷纷。\n升堂□□□□看，况复啼乌不忍闻。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3682,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蒋婿重画","author":"杨士奇","text":"溪鸟溪花似越中，山林清出水西东。\n谁知白发红尘客，钓艇常怀张子同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3683,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄张从善 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"江汉交情四十春，别来衣袂满缁尘。\n平生高义怜张仲，鹤岭鹦洲入梦频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","poi